WEBVTT

00:04:28.542 --> 00:04:33.458
na kuniambia kuwa Patrick 
amepigana na kuua mtu.

00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:37.393
Nilitaharuki.

00:04:37.417 --> 00:04:39.851
Sehemu ya mimi haikuamini,

00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:42.542
na sehemu ya mimi pia iliamini kuwa 
ni kweli.

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:45.583
Nilisafiri kwenda kumuona Patrick.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.458
Nilimtembelea gerezani.

00:04:50.542 --> 00:04:54.184
Na aliniambia kuwa ilikuwa kweli.

00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:56.601
Ya kwamba ameua mtu.

00:04:56.625 --> 00:04:58.875
Na asingependa kuzungumzia suala hilo.

00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:01.851
Nilimuuliza nini kiliendelea kuhusu shule